  "description": "A lightweight, dependency-free collection of high-performance extension methods for modern .NET. Includes ToSlug, Truncate, RemoveWhitespace, IsNullOrWhiteSpace, GetAge, ToHumanTime, ToReadableFileSize, ToOrdinal, IsNullOrEmpty and IsEmpty — every method argument-validated, fully XML-documented, and covered by tests on every target framework. Multi-targets net8.0, net9.0 and net10.0. Trim- and Native AOT-safe, with zero transitive dependencies.",
